## SQ-CS-01 | crop season hook
@group server
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `CropSeasonGrowHookMixin`, `Mixin apply`, `[crop-seasons]`
@pass No mixin apply error; no `[crop-seasons]` error line (an info line about unregistered ids is fine)
@fails SRG name or target class changed (IE, The Dirty Stuff, Nether's Delight updated); json typo
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb passed
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException).*CropSeasonGrowHookMixin
bootreject \[crop-seasons\].*(ERROR|error|Error)

