## SQ-CS-03 | winter: open field behind the glass-roofed field; spring: ahead
@group server
@commands Two 16x16 wheat fields on hydrated farmland, plains, one roofed with glass 3 blocks up; `/season set mid_winter`; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 30`; wait 2 min; count ripe wheat in each (`/execute store` or eyeball). Repeat in `mid_spring`
@pass winter: open field behind the glass field (about 3/4 of it); spring: open field ahead of the glass field (about 5/4)
@fails off penalty or fertile bonus not cancelled under glass, or glass not counted
@from batches/r1031/a2_variants.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# measure = mean wheat age per field (`cdevtest ages`), first line open field (x 100), second glass field (x 120);
# 2 min at randomTickSpeed 30 ripens almost nothing, so ripe counts were noise (10-31 first run)
> kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
> forceload add 96 -4 132 12
> fill 96 -61 -4 132 -61 12 minecraft:grass_block
> fill 100 -61 0 108 -61 8 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock 104 -61 4 minecraft:water
> fill 120 -61 0 128 -61 8 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock 124 -61 4 minecraft:water
> fill 119 -57 -1 129 -57 9 minecraft:glass
> tp qa 114 -60 -6
> fill 100 -60 0 108 -60 8 minecraft:wheat[age=0]
> fill 120 -60 0 128 -60 8 minecraft:wheat[age=0]
> setblock 104 -60 4 minecraft:air
> setblock 124 -60 4 minecraft:air
> season set MID_WINTER
# randomtick replaces 2 min at randomTickSpeed 30 (2400 ticks x 30 / 4096 = about 18 random ticks per block), both
# fields the same; the tick warp runs queued season extra ticks
> cdevtest randomtick 100 -60 0 108 -60 8 18
> cdevtest randomtick 120 -60 0 128 -60 8 18
> cdevtest tickwarp 20
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=20 60
> cdevtest ages 100 -60 0 108 -60 8 minecraft:wheat
> cdevtest ages 120 -60 0 128 -60 8 minecraft:wheat
> fill 100 -60 0 108 -60 8 minecraft:wheat[age=0]
> fill 120 -60 0 128 -60 8 minecraft:wheat[age=0]
> setblock 104 -60 4 minecraft:air
> setblock 124 -60 4 minecraft:air
> season set MID_SPRING
# randomtick replaces 2 min at randomTickSpeed 30 (2400 ticks x 30 / 4096 = about 18 random ticks per block), both
# fields the same; the tick warp runs queued season extra ticks
> cdevtest randomtick 100 -60 0 108 -60 8 18
> cdevtest randomtick 120 -60 0 128 -60 8 18
> cdevtest tickwarp 21
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=21 60
> cdevtest ages 100 -60 0 108 -60 8 minecraft:wheat
> cdevtest ages 120 -60 0 128 -60 8 minecraft:wheat
count verb=randomtick .*done=1 >= 4
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look verb=ages means (open x 100 first, glass x 120 second): winter: open mean below glass mean (about 3/4 of the growth); spring: open mean above glass mean (about 5/4)

